{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":null,"commit_id":"9c0a938d30e6b97688844352af7068563f64d6f7","state":"approved","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3147#pullrequestreview-4280633721","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3147","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3147#pullrequestreview-4280633721"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3147"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-13T10:29:29Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T10:29:29Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","event":"reviewed"},{"sha":"41f973396988e835043d8c4585fbc64a8688c810","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDQxZjk3MzM5Njk4OGU4MzUwNDNkOGM0NTg1ZmJjNjRhODY4OGM4MTA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/41f973396988e835043d8c4585fbc64a8688c810","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/41f973396988e835043d8c4585fbc64a8688c810","author":{"name":"olegnazarov23","email":"olegnazarov23@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-03-15T23:13:47Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T12:23:14Z"},"tree":{"sha":"2c2b9482fb1784608383e4e329305708fe3a4c77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/2c2b9482fb1784608383e4e329305708fe3a4c77"},"message":"Fix list-routes -i flag not filtering by node ID under approve-routes\n\nRegister list-routes as a subcommand of approve-routes so that\n`headscale nodes approve-routes list-routes -i <id>` correctly\nfilters routes by node ID. The -i flag on approve-routes is changed\nto PersistentFlags so it is inherited by the list-routes subcommand.\n\nlist-routes also remains available directly under nodes for backward\ncompatibility (`headscale nodes list-routes -i <id>`).\n\nFixes #2927","parents":[{"sha":"5d502bfb8836b8fd09fb284f6ff494527e11098a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/5d502bfb8836b8fd09fb284f6ff494527e11098a","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/5d502bfb8836b8fd09fb284f6ff494527e11098a"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"199b1549c1e5011827600c47439c4a74900993a8","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDE5OWIxNTQ5YzFlNTAxMTgyNzYwMGM0NzQzOWM0YTc0OTAwOTkzYTg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/199b1549c1e5011827600c47439c4a74900993a8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/199b1549c1e5011827600c47439c4a74900993a8","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T10:24:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@dalby.cc","date":"2026-05-13T12:23:54Z"},"tree":{"sha":"195feff999956d323d90755147b42356f646bba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/195feff999956d323d90755147b42356f646bba7"},"message":"cmd/headscale/cli: reject extra args to approve-routes\n\nWithout Args: NoArgs, `nodes approve-routes <typo> -i N -r \"\"` silently\nclears approved routes on node N via the documented empty-routes\nsentinel. Reject unknown positional args so similar typos fail loudly.\n\nRevert the identifier flag to local Flags from PersistentFlags;\ncombined with mustMarkRequired, the persistent variant propagated\nrequired-validation onto list-routes and broke `nodes approve-routes\nlist-routes` with no -i. The local identifier flag on list-routes\nalready covers the nested invocation.\n\nUpdates #2927","parents":[{"sha":"41f973396988e835043d8c4585fbc64a8688c810","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/41f973396988e835043d8c4585fbc64a8688c810","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/41f973396988e835043d8c4585fbc64a8688c810"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":25481037512,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887zJwgAzwAAAAXuycbI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/25481037512","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"head_ref_force_pushed","commit_id":"199b1549c1e5011827600c47439c4a74900993a8","commit_url":"ht